.TH TARC 1 "2026-03-01" "TARC STRIKE v2.10" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tarc \- TARC STRIKE advanced solid compression archiver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tarc
\fIcommand\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIarchive\fR [\fIfiles\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
TARC STRIKE is a multi-codec solid compression archiver supporting LZMA2,
Zstandard, LZ4, Brotli, and store-only modes. It features deduplication,
streaming compression for large files, SIMD-accelerated operations, and
self-extracting archive (SFX) generation.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B \-c[\fIlevel\fR]
Create archive. Level 1\-19 (default 7). Use \-cbest (level 19) or \-cfast (level 1).
.TP
.B \-x
Extract files from archive. Supports wildcard filters.
.TP
.B \-l
List archive contents.
.TP
.B \-t
Test archive integrity (reads and decompresses all data, verifies checksums, writes nothing).
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help. Combine with \-c, \-x, \-l, \-t for command-specific help.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version information.
.TP
.B \-\-license
Show license information.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-sfx
Create self-extracting archive (.exe).
.TP
.B \-\-flat
Extract files without directory structure.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Overwrite existing files during extraction.
.TP
.B \-\-verify
Verify integrity after operation (default).
.TP
.B \-\-no-verify
Skip integrity verification.
.TP
.B \-\-output-dir \fIpath\fR
Extract files to the specified directory.
.TP
.B \-\-threads \fIN\fR
Set compression threads (default: auto-detect CPU count).
.SH CODECS
.TP
.B \-\-zstd
Force Zstandard compression.
.TP
.B \-\-lzma
Force LZMA2 compression (default).
.TP
.B \-\-lz4
Force LZ4/LZ4HC compression (fastest).
.TP
.B \-\-brotli
Force Brotli compression.
.TP
.B \-\-store
No compression (store only).
.PP
Without a codec override, TARC auto-selects the best codec per file type.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Create archive with default level:
tarc \-c7 backup.strk docs/ images/
.TP
Create with maximum compression and SFX:
tarc \-cbest \-\-sfx portable.exe src/
.TP
Extract all files:
tarc \-x backup.strk
.TP
Extract only .cpp files:
tarc \-x backup.strk "*.cpp"
.TP
Extract to a specific directory:
tarc \-x backup.strk \-\-output-dir ./restore
.TP
List archive contents:
tarc \-l backup.strk
.TP
Test archive integrity:
tarc \-t backup.strk
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
Success.
.TP
1
General error (corrupt archive, file not found, I/O error, etc.).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I *.strk
TARC archive format.
.SH SECURITY
TARC includes path traversal protection (Zip Slip prevention), filename
validation (null byte and control character rejection), and XXH64
checksum verification on every decompressed chunk.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/anomalyco/TARC/issues
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gzip (1),
.BR bzip2 (1),
.BR xz (1),
.BR zstd (1),
.BR lz4 (1)
